        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "《象传》说：被牵连复返阳刚之道且居于中位，说明九二也能不失去自身的阳德。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
